q4os-imager (1.7.6-a1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Bump the version to 1.7.6 so the armhf build sorts above the published
    1.7.5-a1-rpi12 (fused -rpi12 tag needs an upstream bump)
  * Keep the donation heart button visible and clickable during the whole
    write/verify/finalize process; it used to be hidden while writing.
    The cancel buttons sit on the left, the heart on the right
  * Set the desktop file name, so Wayland shows the imager icon in the title
    bar and taskbar instead of a generic one
  * Show the donation address in a message when no web browser is installed,
    instead of letting the desktop open the page source in a text editor
  * No-browser message: a COPY ADDRESS button puts the donation address on the
    clipboard
  * Show the donation hint to the left of the heart, so it covers neither the
    write progress text nor an open message
  * Complete all 12 translations (ca de fr it ja ko nl ru sk sl tr zh), incl.
    the strings that were still untranslated

 -- Jupiter4 foundation <devteam@q4os.org>  Sat, 10 Oct 2026 23:04:09 +0200

